  "intuition": "The static gate failure indicates the required batch keys are not declared via expects. I stabilize and simplify by (1) explicitly declaring expects for 'log_prob_w' and 'log_prob_l' (and optional nonnegative 'weight'), and (2) keeping a numerically stable, preference-consistent logistic margin loss with conservative clamping of the scaled log-prob difference to prevent overflow/underflow. This preserves the original semantics (encourage winner log-prob to exceed loser by a margin) while satisfying interface requirements.",
