  "intuition": "The failure is due to strict expected batch keys: some datasets provide preference log-probs under different names. To stabilize and simplify, the loss now robustly reads winner/loser log-probs from a small set of common key aliases while keeping the core stable -logsigmoid Bradley–Terry objective. It also keeps the existing clamp to prevent extreme gaps from causing numerical issues, and applies optional nonnegative weights with mean reduction.",
